      "actions": 3,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The anacite protector Strides twice; it can move through up to two enemy creatures as part of this movement. Each of these creatures takes 2d6 Bludgeoning Damage damage (Basic DC 15 Reflex Saving Throw save); on a critical failure, the creature is also knocked Prone. Any creature in or adjacent to a square the anacite protector moves through as part of this action is Suppressed until the beginning of the anacite protector's next turn.</p>",
